#: ../../deploy.md:62
msgid ""
"`sapic_secretkey` 是**可选**的：容器部署不传时，entrypoint 首次启动会在数据目录生成 32 字节随机值 "
"并一直复用（默认 `$SAPIC_SECRET_FILE`，即 "
"`/app/server/data/secret_key`），所以只要挂好数据卷就不用手配。 非容器部署（直接 gunicorn / `make "
"serve`）不传仍用内置默认密钥，公网多用户站点建议显式配置 `sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex "
"32>`——它是公开串，读过源码的人能伪造会话 Cookie。 手动换掉密钥等于吊销全部会话。"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_secretkey` is **optional**: the container entrypoint generates a "
"32-byte random value in the data directory on first start and keeps "
"reusing it (default `$SAPIC_SECRET_FILE`, i.e. "
"`/app/server/data/secret_key`), so a mounted data volume is all you need."
" Non-container deployments (bare gunicorn / `make serve`) still fall back"
" to the built-in key; on a public multi-user site set "
"`sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex 32>` explicitly — it is a public "
"string, and anyone who has read the source can forge session cookies. "
"Replacing the key revokes every session."

#: ../../deploy.md:68
msgid ""
