msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../deploy.md:169
msgid ""
"`sapic_proxyfix=1`（或环境变量）必须开：Flask 侧据此信任 `X-Forwarded-Proto/Host`，否则 "
"`request.is_secure` 为假，登录 Cookie 不会带 `Secure`，回调地址也可能拼错。"
msgstr ""
"`sapic_proxyfix=1` (or the environment variable) must be on: Flask then "
"trusts `X-Forwarded-Proto/Host`. Without it `request.is_secure` is false,"
" the session cookie loses `Secure`, and callback URLs may be built wrong."

#: ../../deploy.md:171
msgid ""
"上面的示例是 **nginx 自己终止 TLS**，所以 `X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme` 是对的。如果 nginx "
"前面还有一层 Traefik / WAF / 云负载均衡负责 TLS，`$scheme` 恒为 `http`，必须改成透传， 否则会把外层的 "
"`https` 覆盖掉（容器镜像里的 `docker/nginx.conf` 已用 `map` 做兜底）："
msgstr ""
"The example above has **nginx terminating TLS itself**, so `X-Forwarded-"
"Proto $scheme` is correct. If a Traefik / WAF / cloud load balancer in "
"front of nginx handles TLS, `$scheme` is always `http` and you must pass "
"the header through instead, or the outer `https` gets overwritten (the "
"container `docker/nginx.conf` already does this with a `map`):"

#: ../../deploy.md:184
msgid "**前后端同源**：`/api`、`/raw/` 与静态资源必须在同一个域名/端口下，Cookie 会话才生效。"
msgstr ""
"**Same origin for the front end and the API**: `/api`, `/raw/` and the "
"static assets must be served from the same domain and port for cookie "
"sessions to work."

#: ../../deploy.md:185
msgid ""
"想用 CDN 或独立图片域名时，配 `sapic_external_base_url=https://cdn.example.com`， "
"`/raw` 链接会带该前缀。"
msgstr ""
"To use a CDN or a dedicated image domain, set "
"`sapic_external_base_url=https://cdn.example.com` and `/raw` links get "
"that prefix."

#: ../../deploy.md:187
msgid ""
"**上传上限是三层取最小值**：nginx 的 `client_max_body_size`、进程级 `sapic_maxupload` （映射 "
"`MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH`）、站点设置里按媒体类型的单文件上限 （`upload_image_max_size` / "
"`upload_video_max_size`）。multipart 有额外开销，进程级上限要比 站点上限略大。"
msgstr ""
"**The upload limit is the minimum of three layers**: nginx "
"`client_max_body_size`, the process-level `sapic_maxupload` (mapped to "
"`MAX_CONTENT_LENGTH`) and the per-media-type file limit in the site "
"settings (`upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`). Multipart "
"adds overhead, so keep the process-level limit slightly above the site "
"limit."

#: ../../deploy.md:191
msgid ""
"**防盗链**：用户可在「个性化」里为自己的公开图开启 Referer 校验，拦截发生在 `/raw/`， nginx 只要原样转发 "
"`Referer`（默认就转发），不要清空它。图片走存储直链（存储后端配了加速域名、 或图片是外链登记）时 sapic 不在链路上，需要在 "
"CDN/静态服务器侧另外配置："
msgstr ""
"**Hotlink protection**: users can enable referrer checking for their "
"public images in Personalisation; the check happens on `/raw/`, so nginx "
"only needs to forward `Referer` untouched (it does by default) — never "
"strip it. When images are served from a storage direct link (a backend "
"with an acceleration domain, or an image registered as an external link) "
"sapic is not in the path, so the CDN / static server needs the same rule:"

#: ../../deploy.md:203
msgid "阿里云 OSS / 腾讯云 COS 在控制台「防盗链」里配同一份白名单，并显式选择是否允许空 Referer。"
msgstr ""
"Configure the same allowlist under hotlink protection in the Aliyun OSS /"
" Tencent COS console, and choose explicitly whether an empty Referer is "
"allowed."

#: ../../deploy.md:205
msgid "容器与编排"
msgstr "Containers and orchestration"

#: ../../deploy.md:207
msgid ""
"镜像内已经包含 gunicorn + nginx（nginx 托管 `web/dist`，只把 `/api`、`/raw` 两条前缀反代给后端； "
"油猴脚本在 `/api/v2/userscript.user.js` 下，因此不需要单独开 location），默认监听 80 端口， "
"不需要再单独部署前端。三个进程（gunicorn、`flask sa scheduler`、nginx）由 supervisor 统管， "
"entrypoint 只负责生成密钥、渲染 nginx 配置并跑一次 `flask sa upgrade`：web worker 固定 "
"`sapic_scheduler=0`，后台任务由同容器里的独立调度进程执行，worker 重启不影响定时任务。 容器内监听端口默认 "
"`80`，可用 `SAPIC_HTTP_PORT` 改：`docker/nginx.conf` 是完整 nginx 主配置模板（端口、worker"
" 数是占位符），由 entrypoint 渲染到 `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`，健康检查也会跟着走同一个端口。`docker-"
"compose.yml` 只把宿主的 `SAPIC_PORT`（默认 `80`）映射到容器 `80`。"
msgstr ""
"The image already contains gunicorn and nginx (nginx serves `web/dist` "
"and proxies only the `/api` and `/raw` prefixes to the backend; the "
"userscript lives under `/api/v2/userscript.user.js`, so no extra location"
" is needed) and listens on port 80, so there is no separate front-end "
"deployment. Supervisor manages all three processes (gunicorn, `flask sa "
"scheduler` and nginx); the entrypoint only generates the secret, renders "
"the nginx config and runs `flask sa upgrade` once: the web workers pin "
"`sapic_scheduler=0`, so the background jobs run in the standalone "
"scheduler process inside the same container and a worker restart never "
"interrupts them. The container port defaults to `80` and can be changed "
"with `SAPIC_HTTP_PORT`: `docker/nginx.conf` is now a complete main-config"
" template (port and worker count are placeholders) that the entrypoint "
"renders to `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`; the health check follows the same "
"port. `docker-compose.yml` only maps the host `SAPIC_PORT` (default `80`)"
" to container `80`."

#: ../../deploy.md:217
msgid ""
"gunicorn 的 worker 数由 `sapic_workers` 控制（默认 4，SQLite 建议 1），nginx 的 worker "
"数由容器变量 `SAPIC_NGINX_WORKERS` 控制（默认 `auto`，按 CPU 核数；填正整数可固定）。两者都在模板/配置里， "
"容器启动时一次渲染完成，不再改镜像自带的 nginx 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The gunicorn worker count comes from `sapic_workers` (default 4; use 1 "
"with SQLite), while the nginx worker count is set by the container "
"variable `SAPIC_NGINX_WORKERS` (default `auto`, one per CPU; set a "
"positive integer to pin it). Both live in the template/config and are "
"rendered once at container startup; the image's own nginx config is no "
"longer modified."

#: ../../deploy.md:221
msgid ""
"容器里的 nginx **访问日志和错误日志都关掉**（`access_log off;` / `error_log /dev/null "
"crit;`）， 日志只留应用那份；进程存活与崩溃仍由 supervisor 管理。"
msgstr ""
"The nginx inside the container **disables both access and error logs** "
"(`access_log off;` / `error_log /dev/null crit;`), leaving only the "
"application log; supervisor still manages process liveness and crashes."

#: ../../deploy.md:233
msgid ""
"密钥不用给：entrypoint 会在数据卷里生成并复用。想自己掌控就加一行 `-e sapic_secretkey=\"$(openssl "
"rand -hex 32)\"`（换掉会吊销现有会话）。"
msgstr ""
"You do not have to supply a key: the entrypoint generates one in the data"
" volume and keeps reusing it. To manage it yourself add a line `-e "
"sapic_secretkey=\"$(openssl rand -hex 32)\"` (replacing it revokes "
"existing sessions)."

#: ../../deploy.md:236
msgid "`docker compose up -d` 就是上面那个单容器 + SQLite 的形态："
msgstr "`docker compose up -d` is exactly that single container + SQLite shape:"

#: ../../deploy.md:244
msgid "要 PostgreSQL（多进程/多副本）时在 compose 的 `environment` 里加一行，compose 里不带数据库服务："
msgstr ""
"For PostgreSQL (multiple processes / replicas) add one line to the "
"compose `environment`; compose ships no database service:"

#: ../../deploy.md:250
msgid ""
"`docker-compose.yml` 用 SQLite（库文件在 `sapic-data` 卷里）并把 worker 限成 "
"1，配置全部走环境变量 （只列必需项，其余用默认值）；`kube-sapic.yaml` 只有 Deployment + Service "
"两个对象：单副本， SQLite 落在节点本地目录（`hostPath: /data/sapic`），配置全部写在 Pod 的 `env` "
"里，不需要 Secret/ConfigMap/PVC/Ingress。命名空间由 `kubectl -n` 指定（对象里不写死），使用前替换镜像 "
"tag、 hostPath 路径与 env 里的密钥/域名；没有 Ingress，Service 是 NodePort，外层 HTTPS 反代指向"
" `<节点IP>:<nodePort>`。多节点集群必须把 Pod 固定到同一节点，否则换节点就是空库。 "
"两份清单都只列必需配置，其它项按需要补环境变量，清单见[配置](config.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`docker-compose.yml` uses SQLite (the database file lives on the `sapic-"
"data` volume) and caps workers at 1, with all config passed as "
"environment variables (only the required ones are listed, the rest fall "
"back to defaults). `kube-sapic.yaml` has just two objects, Deployment + "
"Service: a single replica, SQLite on a node-local directory (`hostPath: "
"/data/sapic`) and all config in the Pod `env`, with no "
"Secret/ConfigMap/PVC/Ingress. The namespace is set with `kubectl -n` "
"(nothing is hard-coded), and you must replace the image tag, the hostPath"
" and the secret/domain in `env` before use. There is no Ingress; the "
"Service is a NodePort and the outer HTTPS reverse proxy points at `<node-"
"ip>:<nodePort>`. On a multi-node cluster the Pod must be pinned to one "
"node, otherwise moving nodes means an empty database. Both manifests list"
" only the required settings; add environment variables for anything else "
"— see [Configuration](config.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:258
msgid "要点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../deploy.md:260
msgid ""
"**唯一必须挂载的路径**是 `/app/server/data`：SQLite 数据库、上传文件（`upload/`）与后台安装的 "
"第三方钩子包（`hooks/`）都在这里；不挂卷等于每次重建容器丢数据。"
msgstr ""
"**The only path you must mount** is `/app/server/data`: the SQLite "
"database, uploaded files (`upload/`) and hook packages installed from the"
" admin (`hooks/`) all live there; without a volume every container "
"rebuild loses data."

#: ../../deploy.md:262
msgid "容器内 `sapic_proxyfix=true` 必须开启（compose 与 k8s 已配），否则日志与限流拿到的是 127.0.0.1。"
msgstr ""
"Inside the container `sapic_proxyfix=true` must be on (compose and k8s "
"already set it), otherwise logs and rate limiting see 127.0.0.1."

#: ../../deploy.md:263
msgid "健康检查统一用 `GET /api/v2/health`：数据库不通返回 503。"
msgstr ""
"Use `GET /api/v2/health` for health checks: it returns 503 when the "
"database is unreachable."

#: ../../deploy.md:264
msgid ""
"容器内三个进程由 supervisor 管（配置 `docker/supervisord.conf` → "
"`/etc/supervisord.conf`， socket `/run/supervisord.sock`）：`docker exec "
"sapic supervisorctl status` 看状态， `supervisorctl restart scheduler` "
"只重启调度进程、不动 web；`ps -ef`（`procps`）也能看进程。"
msgstr ""
"Supervisor manages the three processes inside the container (config "
"`docker/supervisord.conf` → `/etc/supervisord.conf`, socket "
"`/run/supervisord.sock`): `docker exec sapic supervisorctl status` shows "
"their state, `supervisorctl restart scheduler` restarts only the "
"scheduler and leaves web alone, and `ps -ef` (from `procps`) lists them "
"too."

#: ../../deploy.md:267
msgid ""
"上传上限有三层，改大小时一起改：nginx `client_max_body_size`（容器内 32m）、 "
"`sapic_maxupload`（25）、后台 `upload_image_max_size` / "
"`upload_video_max_size`。"
msgstr ""
"There are three upload limits; change them together: nginx "
"`client_max_body_size` (32m in the image), `sapic_maxupload` (25) and the"
" admin `upload_image_max_size` / `upload_video_max_size`."

#: ../../deploy.md:269
msgid "本地磁盘存储只能单副本（`Recreate` 策略）；要多副本必须换成对象存储类钩子并给 `/app/server/data` 配 RWX 卷。"
msgstr ""
"Local disk storage only supports a single replica (`Recreate` strategy); "
"multiple replicas require an object-storage hook and an RWX volume for "
"`/app/server/data`."

#: ../../deploy.md:271
msgid ""
"外层 HTTPS 交给宿主机反代或集群外的网关（`kube-sapic.yaml` 只开 NodePort，没有 Ingress）， 并把 "
"`sapic_external_base_url` 设成对外地址，否则图片直链与审核邮件里的登录链接会是内网地址。 反代/Ingress "
"侧的请求体上限要 ≥ 32m，改成 Ingress 时记得加 `nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-"
"size`。"
msgstr ""
"Outer HTTPS belongs to the host reverse proxy or a gateway outside the "
"cluster (`kube-sapic.yaml` only opens a NodePort, there is no Ingress), "
"and `sapic_external_base_url` must be the public address, otherwise image"
" direct links and login links in review emails point at internal "
"addresses. The request-body limit on the proxy/Ingress side must be ≥ "
"32m; when switching to an Ingress, remember `nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io"
"/proxy-body-size`."

#: ../../deploy.md:275
msgid ""
"前面再套一层 Traefik / WAF 时不用改配置：容器内 nginx 用 `map` **透传**上游的 `X-Forwarded-"
"Proto`，不会再把 `https` 覆盖成 `http`（OIDC 回调地址与会话 Cookie 的 `Secure` "
"标志都依赖这个值）。前提是外层只**追加/转发**该头而不改写它；若 WAF 必须改写，用 `sapic_external_base_url` "
"兜住链接生成，并单独核对 OIDC 回调。"
msgstr ""
"No config change is needed for another Traefik / WAF in front: the "
"container nginx **passes through** the upstream `X-Forwarded-Proto` with "
"a `map` and no longer overwrites `https` with `http` (the OIDC callback "
"URL and the cookie `Secure` flag both depend on that value). The premise "
"is that the outer layer only **appends/forwards** the header; if a WAF "
"has to rewrite it, use `sapic_external_base_url` for link generation and "
"verify the OIDC callback separately."

#: ../../deploy.md:279
msgid ""
"WAF 常见坑：`/api/v2/health` 要放行（否则探针被拦会反复重启）、`/raw/*` 关掉响应体检测 "
"（二进制图片会拖慢甚至误杀）、`/api/v2/hooks/*` 放宽超时（后台装钩子会跑 pip 几十秒）、 请求体上限不小于 32m（取值链是"
" WAF ≥ nginx 32m > `sapic_maxupload` 25M > 站点单文件上限）。"
msgstr ""
"Common WAF pitfalls: allow `/api/v2/health` (a blocked probe means "
"restart loops), disable response-body inspection on `/raw/*` (binary "
"images slow it down and get killed), raise timeouts for `/api/v2/hooks/*`"
" (installing a hook runs pip for tens of seconds) and keep the body limit"
" at least 32m (the chain is WAF ≥ nginx 32m > `sapic_maxupload` 25M > the"
" site per-file limit)."

#: ../../deploy.md:282
msgid "升级：拉新镜像重启即可，启动时自动执行数据库迁移（迁移幂等，多 worker 并发有重试保护）。"
msgstr ""
"Upgrading: pull the new image and restart; database migrations run "
"automatically at startup (they are idempotent and concurrent workers "
"retry safely)."

#: ../../deploy.md:295
msgid ""
"迁移在应用启动时**自动执行**（多 worker 并发启动有锁冲突重试 + 迁移幂等，安全）； `flask sa upgrade` "
"只作运维兜底。"
msgstr ""
"Migrations run **automatically** at application startup (concurrent "
"workers retry on lock conflicts and every migration is idempotent, so it "
"is safe); `flask sa upgrade` is only the operational fallback."

#: ../../deploy.md:297
msgid "MySQL 的 DDL 不支持事务，所以每个迁移都写成可重复执行；升级失败先看日志再手工重跑即可。"
msgstr ""
"MySQL DDL is not transactional, so every migration is written to be re-"
"runnable; if an upgrade fails, read the log and run it again by hand."

#: ../../deploy.md:298
msgid "SQLite 适合单机小流量；多 worker 写并发下容易 `database is locked`，生产建议 PostgreSQL/MySQL。"
msgstr ""
"SQLite suits a single machine with light traffic; under concurrent writes"
" from several workers it easily hits `database is locked`, so use "
"PostgreSQL/MySQL in production."

#: ../../deploy.md:300
msgid "首次使用"
msgstr "First steps"

#: ../../deploy.md:302
msgid "用管理员账号登录后台，`/admin/setting` 填站点名/背景/公告，按需打开或关闭注册、匿名上传、图片广场。"
msgstr ""
"Sign in to the admin with the administrator account, fill in site name / "
"background / announcement under `/admin/setting`, and enable or disable "
"registration, anonymous uploads and the image plaza as needed."

#: ../../deploy.md:303
msgid ""
"上传白名单 `upload_allowed_ext`、图片大小 `upload_image_max_size`（默认 10M）、 视频大小 "
"`upload_video_max_size`（默认 20M）、视频开关 `allow_video` 在后台「站点设置」， 与进程级 "
"`sapic_maxupload`（默认 25M，整个请求）是**两层限制**，两边都要放开才能传大文件。"
msgstr ""
"The upload allowlist `upload_allowed_ext`, the image size "
"`upload_image_max_size` (10M by default), the video size "
"`upload_video_max_size` (20M by default) and the video switch "
"`allow_video` are in the admin site settings and form **two layers** "
"together with the process-level `sapic_maxupload` (25M for the whole "
"request) — both must be raised to upload big files."

#: ../../deploy.md:306
msgid ""
"图片有效期：`image_expire_default_days`（未指定时的默认寿命）与 `image_expire_max_days` "
"（单图上限）在后台「站点设置 → 上传」配置，单位天，`0` 表示永久 / 不限制；设了上限后不再允许 "
"永久图片。到期图片会在请求期被节流清理（每进程最多每 5 分钟一批），想更准时可加 cron： `flask sa purge-"
"expired`（应用目录下、用部署用的 Python 执行）。"
msgstr ""
"Image expiry: `image_expire_default_days` (lifetime when none is given) "
"and `image_expire_max_days` (per-image ceiling) are configured under "
"admin site settings → Upload, in days, with `0` meaning permanent / "
"unlimited; once a ceiling is set, permanent images are no longer allowed."
" Expired images are cleaned up on request, throttled (at most one batch "
"per process every 5 minutes); for tighter timing add a cron job: `flask "
"sa purge-expired` (run in the application directory with the deployment "
"Python)."

#: ../../deploy.md:310
msgid ""
"邮件（注册验证、找回密码）在后台配置 SMTP，或启用 `sendcloud` 等 `mail` 类钩子并填好 API 凭据 （配置完整时优先于 "
"SMTP）；不配也能用，但相关功能不可用。 端口决定传输方式：465/994 走隐式 SSL（不勾 STARTTLS），587 勾 "
"STARTTLS，25 一般都不用。 阿里/腾讯企业邮箱用 465 + 授权码（不是登录密码）。"
msgstr ""
"Email (registration verification, password reset) uses the admin SMTP "
"settings, or an enabled `mail` hook such as `sendcloud` with its API "
"credentials filled in (a complete hook takes precedence over SMTP); it is"
" optional, but the related features stay unavailable without it. The port"
" decides the transport: 465/994 use implicit SSL (do not tick STARTTLS), "
"587 uses STARTTLS, 25 is usually not needed. Aliyun / Tencent enterprise "
"mail uses 465 with an authorisation code (not the login password)."

#: ../../deploy.md:314
msgid ""
"统一登录（OIDC）：`/admin/hooks` 启用 `passport`，填 `issuer` / `client_id` / "
"`client_secret`； 在 Passport 侧登记回调地址 "
"`https://img.example.com/api/v2/auth/oidc/passport/callback`。 站内首次登录会用 "
"provider 的稳定标识（uid）建号，昵称只作显示名。 关闭 `password_login` 后只能走统一登录，建议先给管理员账号绑定 "
"OIDC 再关。"
msgstr ""
"Single sign-on (OIDC): enable `passport` under `/admin/hooks` and fill in"
" `issuer` / `client_id` / `client_secret`; register the callback "
"`https://img.example.com/api/v2/auth/oidc/passport/callback` on the "
"Passport side. The first in-site login creates an account from the "
"provider stable identifier (uid), with the nickname used only as display "
"name. Once `password_login` is off only single sign-on works, so bind the"
" administrator account to OIDC first."

#: ../../deploy.md:318
msgid ""
"存储后端：`up2local` 默认启用并自动创建 `local` 后端（写到 `STORAGE_DIR`）。要用云存储： ① 对应 SDK 已随"
" `base.txt` 安装，无需额外操作（第三方钩子才要自己装依赖）； ② `/admin/hooks` "
"只负责启用该驱动（存储驱动的凭据不再在这里填）； ③ 进 `/admin/backends` 编辑该后端，填写必填项（带 *，如 bucket /"
" 操作员 / 密码 / 加速域名）， 可用「检查」探测存储桶；④ 把它「上移」到第一位（或把优先级调到最小），之后新上传才会写到它。 "
"已有图片按副本所在后端读取，所以仍有副本的后端不允许禁用/删除。"
msgstr ""
"Storage backends: `up2local` is enabled by default and creates a `local` "
"backend automatically (writing to `STORAGE_DIR`). To use cloud storage: "
"(1) the SDK ships with `base.txt`, nothing to install (only third-party "
"hooks manage their own dependencies); (2) `/admin/hooks` only enables the"
" driver (storage credentials are no longer entered there); (3) open "
"`/admin/backends`, edit that backend and fill in the required fields "
"(marked *, e.g. bucket / operator / password / acceleration domain), "
"using Check to probe the bucket; (4) move it to the top (or give it the "
"lowest priority number) so new uploads go there. Existing images are read"
" from the backend holding their replica, so a backend that still has "
"replicas cannot be disabled or deleted."

#: ../../deploy.md:325
msgid "各配置项的完整清单见[配置](config.md)。"
msgstr "The full list of options is in [Configuration](config.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:327
msgid "升级、备份与回滚"
msgstr "Upgrades, backups and rollback"

#: ../../deploy.md:329
msgid "升级："
msgstr "Upgrading:"

#: ../../deploy.md:338
msgid "备份："
msgstr "Backups:"

#: ../../deploy.md:340
msgid "数据库：`pg_dump` / `mysqldump` / 直接拷 `sapic.db`（先停服务或 `sqlite3 .backup`）。"
msgstr ""
"Database: `pg_dump` / `mysqldump` / copy `sapic.db` (stop the service "
"first, or use `sqlite3 .backup`)."

#: ../../deploy.md:341
msgid "本地图片：`STORAGE_DIR` 整个目录。"
msgstr "Local images: the whole `STORAGE_DIR` directory."

#: ../../deploy.md:342
msgid "`server/.cfg`（密钥与 DSN）。"
msgstr "`server/.cfg` (secret and DSN)."

#: ../../deploy.md:344
msgid "回滚：迁移幂等但不支持自动回退，回滚代码前先备份数据库；结构不兼容的版本需手工降级数据。"
msgstr ""
"Rollback: migrations are idempotent but have no automatic downgrade, so "
"back up the database before rolling back the code; versions with "
"incompatible schemas need a manual data downgrade."

#: ../../deploy.md:346
msgid "从 v1 升级"
msgstr "Upgrading from v1"

#: ../../deploy.md:348
msgid ""
"数据迁移（Redis → 关系库、文件走存储驱动重传、保留原 `sha`）是独立的一次性操作，完整参数、 云存储采纳规则与客户端改配置都在[从 "
"v1 迁移数据](migrate-v1.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Data migration (Redis → relational database, files re-uploaded through "
"the storage driver, original `sha` preserved) is a one-off operation: "
"full options, cloud-storage adoption rules and client changes are in "
"[Migrating data from v1](migrate-v1.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:351
msgid "这里只强调顺序：**先迁数据、再切流量**，迁移期间停掉 v1 的写入。"
msgstr ""
"Only the order matters here: **migrate the data first, then move "
"traffic**, and stop v1 writes during the migration."

#: ../../deploy.md:353
msgid "观测"
msgstr "Observability"

#: ../../deploy.md:355
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"健康检查：`GET /api/v2/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok|degraded\", \"version\", "
"\"database\"}`， 数据库不通返回 503。"
msgstr ""
"Health: `GET /api/v2/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok|degraded\", "
"\"version\", \"database\"}`; it returns 503 when the database is "
"unreachable."

#: ../../deploy.md:357
msgid ""
"日志：只记**应用日志**，同时写文件与 stdout（systemd 下 `journalctl -u sapic -f`）。 文件在 "
"`sapic_log_dir`（默认 `<server>/data/log`）下的 `sys.log`，按天轮转、保留 10 天 （归档名如 "
"`sys.log.20261121`）；多 worker 下各进程各自轮转，量大时交给 logrotate。 "
"行格式与其它服务一致，方便统一采集：`[ INFO ] 2026-11-21 09:09:41 images.py:735 消息`； "
"请求内的记录在消息前多一个 `rid=<X-Request-Id>`，可与前端报错里的请求 ID 对上。 **不记访问日志**：gunicorn "
"没开，容器里的 nginx 也关掉了访问与错误日志。日志级别用 `sapic_loglevel` 调； 把 `sapic_log_dir` "
"置空则只保留 stdout/stderr。"
msgstr ""
"Logging: only the **application log** is kept, written to a file and to "
"stdout (`journalctl -u sapic -f` under systemd). The file is `sys.log` "
"under `sapic_log_dir` (default `<server>/data/log`), rotated daily and "
"kept for 10 days (archives look like `sys.log.20261121`); each worker "
"rotates its own copy, so hand large volumes to logrotate. Lines follow "
"the usual format for easy collection: `[ INFO ] 2026-11-21 09:09:41 "
"images.py:735 message`; records inside a request carry a `rid=<X-Request-"
"Id>` prefix so they match the request id shown in the front end. **No "
"access log**: gunicorn does not log them and the container nginx disables"
" both access and error logs. Use `sapic_loglevel` to change the level; "
"leaving `sapic_log_dir` empty keeps stdout/stderr only."

#: ../../deploy.md:365
msgid "每个请求都会带 `X-Request-Id`（也可由上游传入），排查时用它串日志。"
msgstr ""
"Every request carries `X-Request-Id` (it can also be passed in from "
"upstream); use it to follow a request through the logs."

#: ../../deploy.md:367
msgid "后台任务（到期清理、审核扫描与演示账号改密）"
msgstr "Background jobs (expiry purge, moderation scan and demo password rotation)"

#: ../../deploy.md:369
msgid "后台任务由进程内 APScheduler 驱动，随服务启动，**不需要 cron**："
msgstr ""
"The background jobs are driven by an in-process APScheduler that starts "
"with the service — **no cron needed**:"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "任务"
msgstr "Job"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "默认间隔"
msgstr "Default interval"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "作用"
msgstr "What it does"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "过期清理"
msgstr "Expiry purge"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "600s（`sapic_scheduler_purge_interval`）"
msgstr "600s (`sapic_scheduler_purge_interval`)"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "删除到期图片的对象与元数据"
msgstr "Delete the objects and rows of expired images"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "审核扫描"
msgstr "Moderation scan"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "300s（`sapic_scheduler_review_interval`）"
msgstr "300s (`sapic_scheduler_review_interval`)"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "调 `moderator` 钩子判定未审的图；无此钩子时直接跳过"
msgstr ""
"Ask the `moderator` hook about unreviewed images; skipped entirely when "
"no such hook is enabled"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "演示账号改密"
msgstr "Demo password rotation"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "60s 检查，实际间隔看后台设置 `demo_rotate_interval`"
msgstr ""
"Checked every 60s; the real interval comes from the admin setting "
"`demo_rotate_interval`"

#: ../../deploy.md:25
msgid "把指定账号的密码重置回配置值；未开启时直接跳过"
msgstr ""
"Reset the given account's password back to the configured value; skipped "
"when not enabled"

#: ../../deploy.md:377
msgid ""
"**多 worker 选主**：每个 worker 启动时抢 `server/data/scheduler.lock` "
"的文件锁（`flock`）， 只有抢到的进程跑调度，其余跳过，所以 `gunicorn -w 4` 不会跑四份。"
msgstr ""
"**Leader election among workers**: every worker tries to lock the "
"`server/data/scheduler.lock` file (`flock`) at startup, the winner runs "
"the schedule and the rest skip it, so `gunicorn -w 4` does not run four "
"copies."

#: ../../deploy.md:379
msgid ""
"**多副本**：各 Pod 有独立数据卷时锁不共享，会各自跑一份。调度任务本身幂等 "
"（清理按行、审核按行原子抢占），重复执行只是浪费；要严格单点就在 web 端设 `sapic_scheduler=0`，另起一个 `flask "
"sa scheduler` 的独立 Deployment / systemd 服务。"
msgstr ""
"**Several replicas**: pods with separate data volumes do not share the "
"lock and each run one copy. The jobs are idempotent (purge works row by "
"row, moderation claims rows atomically), so a duplicate run only wastes "
"work; for a strict single leader set `sapic_scheduler=0` on the web side "
"and run `flask sa scheduler` as a separate Deployment / systemd unit."

#: ../../deploy.md:382
msgid "**独立进程跑**（web 让位）："
msgstr "**Run it as its own process** (web steps aside):"

#: ../../deploy.md:389
msgid ""
"**容器镜像默认就是这个形态**：supervisor 拉起独立的 `flask sa scheduler`，web worker 固定 "
"`sapic_scheduler=0`（`Dockerfile` 与 "
"`docker/supervisord.conf`），所以不需要额外服务，也别在编排里把 `sapic_scheduler` 改回 "
"1。此时「定时任务」页的调度者显示为 `external`。"
msgstr ""
"**The container image already works this way**: supervisor starts a "
"standalone `flask sa scheduler` and the web workers pin "
"`sapic_scheduler=0` (set in `Dockerfile` and `docker/supervisord.conf`), "
"so no extra service is needed — and do not flip `sapic_scheduler` back to"
" 1 in your manifests. The scheduler page reports this leader as "
"`external`."

#: ../../deploy.md:393
msgid "一次性执行（k8s CronJob 等）："
msgstr "Run once (k8s CronJob and friends):"

#: ../../deploy.md:398
msgid ""
"**后台可观测**：管理员在「后台管理 → 定时任务」看当前调度者、各任务的间隔/下次运行/上次结果， "
"也可以「立即执行」一次（同步执行、批量很小，不会等太久）。多 worker 下这一页显示的是 "
"**处理该请求的进程**：落在待命进程时会标「其他进程调度中」，手动执行仍然有效。"
msgstr ""
"**Visible in the admin area**: the scheduler page shows the current "
"scheduler, each job's interval / next run / last result, and a run-now "
"button (executed synchronously with a small batch, so the request returns"
" quickly). With several workers the page describes **the process that "
"handled the request**: a standby says “scheduling in another process”, "
"and run-now still works."

#: ../../deploy.md:401
msgid ""
"审核命中默认只把图片**隐藏**（`review_state=block`），记录与文件都还在；管理员在后台 "
"「审核队列」页（`/admin/review`）复核，逐张或批量（`POST /api/v2/review/batch`）用 `approve` "
"恢复或 `purge` 物理删除。站点设置 `review_auto_purge`（默认关）打开后， 判为 `block` 会立即 "
"purge、不再进队列等人复核；不可逆，误判无法挽回，按需开启。"
msgstr ""
"A moderation hit by default only **hides** the image (`review_state=block`); "
"the row and the file stay. Admins review it in the admin Review queue page "
"(`/admin/review`) and restore with `approve` or physically delete with "
"`purge`, one by one or in bulk (`POST /api/v2/review/batch`). With the site "
"setting `review_auto_purge` on (off by default), a `block` is purged "
"immediately and never enters the queue — irreversible, so enable it only if "
"you accept that a false positive cannot be undone."

#: ../../deploy.md:405
msgid ""
"审核只扫公开可见图片；钩子拿到的 `url` 优先是 `external_base_url + /raw/<sha>`，未配置时回退到 "
"登记外链或公开副本直链。契约见[内容审核](extend/moderator.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Only publicly visible images are moderated. The hook's `url` is "
"`external_base_url + /raw/<sha>` when configured; otherwise it falls back"
" to a registered external link or a public replica URL. See [content "
"moderation](extend/moderator.md)."

#: ../../deploy.md:408
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../deploy.md:410
msgid "启动失败、登录掉线、上传 413、`/raw` 404、钩子装不上等症状统一归到[常见问题](faq.md)， 本页只讲「怎么装起来」。"
msgstr ""
"Startup failures, lost sessions, upload 413s, `/raw` 404s and hooks that "
"will not install are all collected in [Troubleshooting](faq.md); this "
"page is only about getting it installed."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`sapic_secretkey` 是**可选**的：不写就用内置默认密钥。但它是公开串，公网多用户站点建议加一行 "
#~ "`sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex "
#~ "32>`，否则读过源码的人能伪造会话 Cookie。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`sapic_secretkey` is **optional**: without it"
#~ " the built-in default key is "
#~ "used. But it is a public string,"
#~ " so a public multi-user site "
#~ "should add `sapic_secretkey=<openssl rand -hex"
#~ " 32>`, otherwise anyone who has read"
#~ " the source can forge session "
#~ "cookies."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "日志：默认输出到 stdout（systemd 下 `journalctl -u "
#~ "sapic -f`）；日志级别用 `sapic_loglevel` 调。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Logs: stdout by default (`journalctl -u"
#~ " sapic -f` under systemd); adjust the"
#~ " level with `sapic_loglevel`."

